    "contentEn": "<p><span>The Aerolase Neo Elite is one of the most advanced therapeutic laser devices, capable of treating more than 30 different skin conditions such as acne, scars, pigmentation, and more, in a short time, without pain and with no downtime.</span></p>\n<h2><span>What Is the Aerolase Neo Elite Device?</span></h2>\n<p><span>Aerolase Neo Elite is an advanced American laser device that uses ultra-short pulse technology (650 microseconds), allowing high energy to be delivered effectively and precisely without causing damage to the skin’s surface. This innovative technology makes the treatment safe, comfortable, and effective for a wide range of skin concerns.</span></p>\n<p><span>The device works by delivering laser pulses into the deeper layers of the skin to help:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li aria-level=\"1\"><span>Stimulate collagen production.</span></li>\n<li aria-level=\"1\"><span>Reduce inflammation and redness.</span></li>\n<li aria-level=\"1\"><span>Eliminate acne-causing bacteria.</span></li>\n<li aria-level=\"1\"><span>Target pigmentation and even out skin tone.</span>&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span>All of this is achieved in a comfortable, painless way.</span></p>\n<h2><span>What Conditions Does It Treat?</span></h2>\n<p><span> The device is distinguished by its ability to treat a wide variety of skin issues, most notably:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li aria-level=\"1\"><span>Acne and post-acne scars.</span></li>\n<li aria-level=\"1\"><span>Melasma.</span></li>\n<li aria-level=\"1\"><span>Rosacea.</span></li>\n<li aria-level=\"1\"><span>Skin pigmentation.</span></li>\n<li aria-level=\"1\"><span>Enlarged pores.</span></li>\n<li aria-level=\"1\"><span>Nail fungus.</span></li>\n<li aria-level=\"1\"><span>Warts and skin tags.</span></li>\n<li aria-level=\"1\"><span>Scars.</span></li>\n<li aria-level=\"1\"><span>Signs of aging.</span>&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span>It is an ideal solution for those seeking a comprehensive, multi-purpose treatment.</span></p>\n<h2><span>What About Pain During and After the Session?</span></h2>\n<p><span> One of the key advantages of the Aerolase Neo Elite device is that it is:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li aria-level=\"1\"><span>A painless treatment.</span></li>\n<li aria-level=\"1\"><span>No needles or anesthesia required.</span></li>\n<li aria-level=\"1\"><span>No cooling needed.</span></li>\n<li aria-level=\"1\"><span>No downtime.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span>This means you can return to your daily activities immediately after the session, making it an excellent choice for a fast-paced lifestyle.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Safe for All Skin Types and Tones</span></h2>\n<p><span> The Aerolase Neo Elite device is specifically designed to be safe for all skin types, from white to dark. Thanks to its short-pulse technology and non-contact delivery, many risks are significantly reduced, including:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li aria-level=\"1\"><span>Burns.</span></li>\n<li aria-level=\"1\"><span>Post-treatment pigmentation.</span></li>\n<li aria-level=\"1\"><span>Skin inflammation and infection.</span>&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span>How Many Sessions Are Needed to See Results?</span></h2>\n<p><span> Some cases may notice visible improvement after the first session, while results continue to improve gradually with additional treatments, providing healthy and radiant skin over the long term. In general, 4–6 sessions are recommended, spaced 2–4 weeks apart.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Can It Be Combined with Other Aesthetic Treatments?</span></h2>\n<p><span> Yes, Aerolase Neo Elite sessions can be combined with many aesthetic treatments such as:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li aria-level=\"1\"><span>Botox.</span></li>\n<li aria-level=\"1\"><span>Dermal fillers.</span></li>\n<li aria-level=\"1\"><span>Collagen-stimulating injections.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span>This combination enhances skin quality and delivers more balanced, comprehensive aesthetic results.</span></p>\n<h2><span>How to Care for Your Skin After the Session</span></h2>\n<p><span> In the first few days after treatment, we recommend following certain care instructions to achieve optimal results. Key tips include:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li aria-level=\"1\"><b>Continuous moisturizing.</b></li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li aria-level=\"1\"><b>Gentle cleansing: </b><span>wash the skin with lukewarm to cool water using a mild cleanser recommended by your physician.</span></li>\n<li aria-level=\"1\"><b>Avoid harsh products:</b><span> refrain from using makeup, retinol and its derivatives, or exfoliating products for 2–4 days.</span></li>\n<li aria-level=\"1\"><b>Avoid heat and excessive sweating as much as possible:</b><span> stay away from intense workouts, hot baths, saunas, and steam rooms for 24–48 hours.</span></li>\n<li aria-level=\"1\"><b>Sun protection:</b><span> avoid direct sun exposure and apply a broad-spectrum sunscreen with SPF 30 or higher.</span>&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span>Why Did We Choose the Aerolase Neo Elite Device in Our Clinic?</span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li aria-level=\"1\"><span>Advanced, globally approved laser technology.</span></li>\n<li aria-level=\"1\"><span>Fast and effective results.</span></li>\n<li aria-level=\"1\"><span>Maximum comfort during treatment.</span></li>\n<li aria-level=\"1\"><span>High safety for all skin tones.</span></li>\n<li aria-level=\"1\"><span>One device that treats more than 30 skin conditions.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span>We believe that proper skin care begins with choosing the right technology and specialized medical expertise.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Book Your Consultation Today</span></h2>\n<p><span> If you are looking for an advanced, safe, and effective treatment to improve the health and radiance of your skin, Aerolase Neo Elite is the ideal choice for you.</span><span><br />\n</span><span> Book your consultation today and let our medical team create a personalized treatment plan tailored to your skin’s needs.</span></p>\n",
