    "slug": "gum-disease-treatment",
    "titleEn": "5 Essential Steps for Effective Gum Disease Treatment Before It Gets Worse",
    "requestedTitleEn": "5 Essential Steps for Effective Gum Disease Treatment Before It Gets Worse",
